     "body": "$$\\mathit{CausesWithin}(c, e, d) \\Leftrightarrow \\forall t:\\ c(\\rho, t) \\Rightarrow \\exists t' \\in [t, t + d]:\\ e(\\rho, t')$$\n\nReq 06 says \"in less than 2 seconds\", so a start at exactly 2 s should fail, but it passes. MTL can write the strict bound as $\\mathbf{F}_{[0,2)}$."
